Looking at this problem, I need to find the minimum number of students guaranteeing that 2010 questions can always be split into three folders of 670, each folder given to a student who solved all its questions, given that at most 2 students failed any given question.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem text contains no leaked solutions or answer values. Proceeding to solve.

